            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "प्रवासानंतर त्याला खूप थकवा आला. pravāsānantar tyālā khūp thakvā ālā. He felt very tired after the journey."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "Masculine."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "From थकणे, to get tired: थकवा (thakvā) येणे, with the dative."
            }
          ]
        },
