          "type": "etymology",
          "title": "The word, taken apart",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "थकवा (thakvā) is the Marathi noun of थकणे, \"to get tired\", which goes back to the reconstructed sthakk, \"stop, halt\" (CDIAL 13737)."
            }
          ]
